@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "非计划 DOWN\nUA / Normal" as O_UA #EAF2F8
rectangle "DA / Normal" as O_DA #EAF2F8
rectangle "DI / HasRefs\nNormal" as O_DI_R #EAF2F8
rectangle "DI / NoRefs\nNormal" as O_DI_E #EAF2F8
rectangle "REMOVED" as O_REMOVED #EAF2F8

O_UA -right-> O_DA : DOWN\nset_disk_down
O_DA -right-> O_DI_R : DOWN\nwait_then_disable
O_DI_R -right-> O_DI_E : DOWN\nVDM.evacuate\nverify no refs
O_DI_E -right-> O_REMOVED : DOWN\nremove

rectangle "计划 Shrink\nUA / Normal" as S_UA #E8F8F5
rectangle "UA / Shrinking" as S_UA_S #E8F8F5
rectangle "UI / HasRefs\nShrinking" as S_UI_R #E8F8F5
rectangle "UI / NoRefs\nShrinking" as S_UI_E #E8F8F5
rectangle "DI / NoRefs\nShrinking" as S_DI_E #E8F8F5
rectangle "REMOVED" as S_REMOVED #E8F8F5

S_UA -right-> S_UA_S : Shrink\nrequest_shrink
S_UA_S -right-> S_UI_R : Shrink or UP\ndisable_allocation
S_UI_R -right-> S_UI_E : Shrink or UP\nVDM.evacuate\nverify no refs
S_UI_E -right-> S_DI_E : same active event\nset_disk_down
S_DI_E -right-> S_REMOVED : same active event\nremove

O_UA -[hidden]down-> S_UA
O_DA -[hidden]down-> S_UA_S
O_DI_R -[hidden]down-> S_UI_R
O_DI_E -[hidden]down-> S_UI_E
O_REMOVED -[hidden]down-> S_REMOVED

note bottom of O_DI_R
HasRefs / NoRefs 由 VDM 权威查询，
不是 MemberDisk 保存的状态副本。
只有排空转换读取 VDM；
DOWN 安全转换不依赖 VDM。
end note

note bottom of S_UI_R
每条边都是：
start_state + event
-> await action
-> verify finish_state
end note

note bottom of S_UI_E
Shrink 排空中收到 DOWN：
当前 VDM Future 先协作稳定退出；
再执行 set_disk_down；
随后从 DI / Shrinking 继续排空。
end note

note bottom of S_DI_E
Transitioned 后重新读取权威状态，
继续驱动同一个 active event。

UP 可从 DA / DI 协作替换为 open_and_serve；
REMOVED + UP 进入 Rejoin。
end note
@enduml
